  "title": "Herbed Brie in Puff Pastry",
  "description": "Brie is topped with mixed herbs, garlic, and salami, wrapped in puff pastry and baked to a beautiful golden brown for this awesome special occasion appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "Tiffany"
  ],
